{"id":20902,"artist":"Nat King Cole","title":"A Blossom Fell","lyrics_plain":"A blossom fell from off a tree\nIt settled softly on the lips you turned to me\nThe gypsies say and I know why\nA falling blossom only touches lips that lie\n\nA blossom fell and very soon\nI saw you kissing someone new beneath the moon\nI thought you loved me, you said you loved me\nWe planned together to dream forever\nThe dream has ended, for true love died\nThe night a blossom fell and touched two lips that lied\n\nA blossom fell and very soon\nI saw you kissing someone new beneath the moon\nI thought you loved me, you said you loved me\nWe planned together to dream forever\nThe dream has ended, for true love died\nThe night a blossom fell and touched two lips that lied","lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] A Blossom FellWords and Music by: Howard Barnes, Harold Cornelius and Dominic JohnPerformed by:  Nat \"King\" Cole (1955)Sequenced by:  Ron Tilden\n[00:14.15] A blossom fell from off a tree\n[00:20.92] It settled softly on the lips you turned to me\n[00:27.68] The gypsies say and I know why\n[00:34.44] \"A falling blossom only touches lips that lie\"\n[00:41.20] A blossom fell and very soon\n[00:47.96] I saw you kissing someone new beneath the moon\n[00:54.72] I thought you loved me, you said you loved me\n[01:01.48] We planned together to dream forever\n[01:08.24] The dream has ended, for true love died\n[01:15.00] The night a blossom fell and touched two lips that lied\n[01:21.13] <instrumental interlude>\n[01:48.80] A blossom fell and very soon\n[01:55.56] I saw you kissing someone new beneath the moon\n[02:02.32] I thought you loved me, you said you loved me\n[02:09.08] We planned together to dream forever\n[02:15.85] The dream has ended, for true love died\n[02:22.61] The night a blossom fell and touched two lips that lied\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:14.15] <00:14.15>A <00:14.36>blos <00:14.99>som <00:15.21>fell <00:17.53>from <00:17.74>off <00:18.38>a <00:18.59>tree\n[00:20.91] <0